sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-19-petroff-kahng-audit-kahng-coral-geometry-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Kahng, Odle & Wakeman (2024) Reef-Coral Colony Geometry & Surface-Area Productivity — Morphometric validation: 38/100" ;
        rdfs:comment "Computes and reports asymptotic linear extensions (`1.28 cm/yr` for massive *Porites*; `2.00, 2.53, 3.99, 7.36 cm/yr` for *Acropora* cones with `alpha = 0.5..4`), size-independent SAP (`0.114 /yr` for *Leptoseris* disc; `7.143 /yr` for *Acropora* cylinder), and the `18.9x` (`~19x`) microfragmentation SAP ratio between `r = 1 cm` (`1.86 /yr`) and `r = 25 cm` (`0.10 /yr`). Deduct 42 points because no empirical colony growth dataset (e.g., Lough 2008 *Porites* cores, Hughes 1987 *Acropora*, or Kahng 2023 *Leptoseris* measurements) is loaded to compute residuals or $R^2$; and deduct 20 points because no CSV table or automated `--self-test` verification is emitted. Evidence: 2024-kahng-coral-geometry.py L215–L236: computes sap_small (r=1 cm), sap_large (r=25 cm), and ~19x microfragmentation ratio <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/2024-kahng-coral-geometry.py#L215-L236>; 2024-kahng-coral-geometry.py L250–L264: console verification printout of asymptotic C and size-independent SAP <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5564750/2024-kahng-coral-geometry.py#L250-L264>. Measurements (measure_outputs.py): massive Porites hemisphere linear extension C at r = 30 cm (discrete 1-yr step) = 1.2301 cm/yr (reference 1.2812, Kahng, Odle & Wakeman 2024 PeerJ 12:e17037 Appendix A (continuum C = G/rho = 1.2812 cm/yr)) [hemisphere_extension(r=30 cm, G=1.64, rho=1.28) = (r^3 + 3*G*r^2/rho)^(1/3) - r] — at r = 1 cm discrete step gives C = 0.6920 cm/yr due to 1-yr forward-Euler discretization; massive Porites microfragmentation SAP speedup ratio (r = 1 cm vs r = 25 cm) = 18.6207 SAP(1 cm) / SAP(25 cm) (reference 18.92, Kahng, Odle & Wakeman 2024 PeerJ 12:e17037 (SAP(1 cm)=1.8558/yr vs SAP(25 cm)=0.0981/yr)) [hemisphere_sap(r=1 cm) / hemisphere_sap(r=25 cm) for G=1.64, rho=1.28]; deep-water Leptoseris flat-disc size-independent SAP (h = 0.20 cm) = 0.1142 yr^-1 (reference 0.1142, Kahng, Odle & Wakeman 2024 PeerJ 12:e17037 / Kahng 2023) [disc_sap(G=0.061, rho=2.67, h=0.20) = G / (rho * h)]; branching Acropora cylinder size-independent SAP (r = 0.50 cm) = 7.1429 yr^-1 (reference 7.1429, Kahng, Odle & Wakeman 2024 PeerJ 12:e17037 / Hughes 1987) [cylinder_sap(G=2.50, rho=1.40, r=0.50) = 2 * G / (rho * r)]." ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-kahng-coral-geometry-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:hasProbability "0.38"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "unfaithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-kahng-coral-geometry-morphometric-validation> rdfs:label "Kahng, Odle & Wakeman (2024) Reef-Coral Colony Geometry & Surface-Area Productivity (2024-kahng-coral-geometry.py, docs/media/kahng_coral_geometry_growth.gif) satisfies the MorphoEval 0.1.0 criterion 'Morphometric validation' for Scleractinian reef corals (massive Porites, branching Acropora, plating Leptoseris)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Fable 5.1 (independent blinded second assessor)" .
}

